This release redistributes a Core ML conversion of
"tarteel-ai/whisper-base-ar-quran" (Tarteel AI), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, which is itself a fine-tuned version of OpenAI's Whisper
(base), also Apache License 2.0. Tokenizer files originate from
"openai/whisper-base". Conversion performed with whisperkittools (Argmax Inc.,
MIT License). No changes were made to the model weights other than conversion
to the Core ML format.
